  "question": {
    "text": "For three positive integers&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>r</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;such that&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math>are in&nbsp; A.P. with common difference&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>. The&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>is equal to&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
